[{"id":"fm-core1-1.33-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>Sketch the following graphs, identifying where they intersect the coordinate axes and the equations of any asymptotes:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\arsinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\arcosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\artanh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/solutions/assets/diagrams/133-sol-1a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/solutions/assets/diagrams/133-sol-1b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/solutions/assets/diagrams/133-sol-1c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.33-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>Sketch the following pairs of graphs on the same axes. Label each graph clearly and show where they intersect the coordinate axes:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\arsinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=3\\arsinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\arsinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\arsinh(x-2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\arsinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-\\arsinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\arcosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\arcosh\\frac12x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\arcosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\arcosh(x+3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\arcosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\arcosh(-x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/solutions/assets/diagrams/133-sol-2a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/solutions/assets/diagrams/133-sol-2b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/solutions/assets/diagrams/133-sol-2c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/solutions/assets/diagrams/133-sol-2d.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">e)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/solutions/assets/diagrams/133-sol-2e.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">f)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/solutions/assets/diagrams/133-sol-2f.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.33-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>By considering the point of inflection (identified on the graphs by a <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\times\" data-display=\"false\"></span>), find the equation of each of the following graphs in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\arsinh(x-a)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\arsinh x+b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are integers:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/questions/assets/diagrams/133-q3a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/questions/assets/diagrams/133-q3b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\arsinh x+b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-\\frac{21}{20},0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"0=\\arsinh(-\\frac{21}{20})+b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0=\\ln(-\\frac{21}{20}+\\sqrt{(-\\frac{21}{20})^2+1})+b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0=\\ln(-\\frac{21}{20}+\\frac{29}{20})+b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow b=-\\ln\\frac25=\\ln\\frac52\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore y=\\arsinh x+\\ln\\frac52\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\arsinh(x-a)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,\\ln(\\frac{\\sqrt{13}-3}{2}))\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\ln(\\frac{\\sqrt{13}-3}{2})=\\arsinh(-a)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\ln(\\frac{\\sqrt{13}-3}{2})=\\ln(-a+\\sqrt{(-a)^2+1})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\ln(\\frac{\\sqrt{13}-3}{2})=\\ln(-a+\\sqrt{a^2+1})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\frac{\\sqrt{13}-3}{2}=-a+\\sqrt{a^2+1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow a+\\frac{\\sqrt{13}-3}{2}=\\sqrt{a^2+1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow(a+\\frac{\\sqrt{13}-3}{2})^2=a^2+1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow a^2+(\\sqrt{13}-3)a+\\frac{11-3\\sqrt{13}}2=a^2+1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow(\\sqrt{13}-3)a+\\frac{11-3\\sqrt{13}}2=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow(\\sqrt{13}-3)a=\\frac{3\\sqrt{13}-9}{2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow a=\\frac{3\\sqrt{13}-9}{2\\sqrt{13}-6}=\\frac32\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore y=\\arsinh(x-\\frac32)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.33-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>Find the equation of each of the following graphs in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\arcosh(x-a)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\arcosh x+b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are integers:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/questions/assets/diagrams/133-q4a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/questions/assets/diagrams/133-q4b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\arcosh x+b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(\\frac{13}{5},0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"0=\\arcosh\\frac{13}{5}+b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0=\\ln(\\frac{13}{5}+\\sqrt{(\\frac{13}{5})^2-1})+b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0=\\ln(\\frac{13}{5}+\\frac{12}{5})+b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0=\\ln5+b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow b=-\\ln5\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore y=\\arcosh x-\\ln5\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\arcosh(x-a)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,\\ln(3+2\\sqrt2))\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\ln(3+2\\sqrt2)=\\arcosh(-a)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\ln(3+2\\sqrt2)=\\ln(-a+\\sqrt{(-a)^2-1})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\ln(3+2\\sqrt2)=\\ln(-a+\\sqrt{a^2-1})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow3+2\\sqrt2=-a+\\sqrt{a^2-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow a+3+2\\sqrt2=\\sqrt{a^2-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow(a+3+2\\sqrt2)^2=a^2-1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow a^2+(6+4\\sqrt2)a+12\\sqrt2+17=a^2-1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow(6+4\\sqrt2)a+12\\sqrt2+17=-1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow(6+4\\sqrt2)a=-18-12\\sqrt2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow a=-\\frac{18+12\\sqrt2}{6+4\\sqrt2}=-3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore y=\\arcosh(x+3)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.33-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>State the equations of the asymptotes of the following graphs:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\artanh(x+5)-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\artanh(x-\\frac13)+2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\artanh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has horizontal asymptotes at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\artanh x\\mapsto y=\\artanh(x+5)-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a translation by the vector <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}-5\\\\-3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the vertical asymptotes are translated 5 units to the left.</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore y=\\tanh(x+5)-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has vertical asymptotes at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-6\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\artanh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has horizontal asymptotes at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\artanh x\\mapsto y=\\artanh(x-\\frac13)+2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a translation by the vector <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}\\frac13\\\\2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the vertical asymptotes are translated <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac13\" data-display=\"false\"></span> units to the right.</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore y=\\tanh(x-\\frac13)+2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has vertical asymptotes at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-\\frac23\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\frac43\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.33-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>Sketch each of the following graphs, identifying where they intersect the coordinate axes and the equations of any asymptotes:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\artanh x-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\artanh(x+3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\artanh(x-\\frac12)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-\\artanh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/solutions/assets/diagrams/133-sol-6a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/solutions/assets/diagrams/133-sol-6b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/solutions/assets/diagrams/133-sol-6c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/solutions/assets/diagrams/133-sol-6d.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.33-q7","number":7,"question":"<p>Sketch each of the following graphs, identifying where they intersect the coordinate axes and the equations of any asymptotes:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\artanh3x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\artanh\\frac14x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/solutions/assets/diagrams/133-sol-7a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/solutions/assets/diagrams/133-sol-7b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.33-q8","number":8,"question":"<p>In each of the following graphs, the point of inflection is identified by a <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\times\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Find the equation of each in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\artanh(x-a)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\artanh x+b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are integers:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/questions/assets/diagrams/133-q8a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/questions/assets/diagrams/133-q8b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/questions/assets/diagrams/133-q8c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{-\\frac{13}{8}+\\frac38}{2}=-\\frac58\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\artanh(x+\\frac58)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\artanh x+b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-\\frac45,0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"0=\\artanh(-\\frac45)+b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0=\\frac12\\ln\\frac{1+(-\\frac45)}{1-(-\\frac45)}+b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0=\\frac12\\ln\\frac{1+(-\\frac45)}{1-(-\\frac45)}+b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0=\\frac12\\ln\\frac19+b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0=\\ln\\frac13+b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow b=-\\ln\\frac13=\\ln3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore y=\\artanh x+\\ln3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\artanh(x-a)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,\\ln(\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}))\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\ln(\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2})=\\artanh(-a)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\ln(\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2})=\\frac12\\ln\\frac{1+(-a)}{1-(-a)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow2\\ln(\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2})=\\ln\\frac{1-a}{1+a}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\ln\\frac12=\\ln\\frac{1-a}{1+a}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\frac12=\\frac{1-a}{1+a}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow1+a=2-2a\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow3a=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow a=\\frac13\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore y=\\artanh(x-\\frac13)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.33-q9","number":9,"question":"<p>Sketch the following graphs, given <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k&gt;1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, identifying where they intersect the coordinate axes and the equations of any asymptotes:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\arsinh(x-k)+k\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\arcosh(x+k)-k\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\artanh(x-k)-k\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/solutions/assets/diagrams/133-sol-9a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/solutions/assets/diagrams/133-sol-9b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/solutions/assets/diagrams/133-sol-9c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.33-q10","number":10,"question":"<p>Sketch each of the following graphs, identifying where they intersect the coordinate axes and the equations of any asymptotes:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2-\\arsinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-\\arcosh2x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\artanh(\\frac12x+1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\arsinh(1-x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-\\arcosh(-x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-\\artanh2x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/solutions/assets/diagrams/133-sol-10a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/solutions/assets/diagrams/133-sol-10b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/solutions/assets/diagrams/133-sol-10c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/solutions/assets/diagrams/133-sol-10d.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">e)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/solutions/assets/diagrams/133-sol-10e.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">f)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/solutions/assets/diagrams/133-sol-10f.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.33-q11","number":11,"question":"<p>Both of the following inverse hyperbolic curves are transformations of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\arcosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. No horizontal stretches have been performed. Given <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a constant where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1&lt;k&lt;3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find a suitable equation for each:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/questions/assets/diagrams/133-q11a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/questions/assets/diagrams/133-q11b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>First consider <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\arcosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p>Translate by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}-k\\\\-2k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to get <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\arcosh(x+k)-2k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p>But this isn’t quite right as the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-intercept should be <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{e^2+e^{-2}}2-k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> instead of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{e^{2k}+e^{-2k}}2-k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>So start again with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\arcosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p>Then stretch, parallel to the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis, by scale factor <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to get <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=k\\arcosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p>Translate by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}-k\\\\-2k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to get <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=k\\arcosh(x+k)-2k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore y=k\\arcosh(x+k)-2k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>First consider <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\arcosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p>Reflect in the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis to get <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-\\arcosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p>Translate by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}k\\\\k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to get <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-\\arcosh(x-k)+k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p>But this isn’t quite right as the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-intercept should be <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{e+e^{-1}}2-k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> instead of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{e^k+e^{-k}}2-k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>So start again with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\arcosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p>Then stretch, parallel to the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis, by scale factor <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to get <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=k\\arcosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p>Reflect in the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis to get <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-k\\arcosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p>Translate by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}k\\\\k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to get <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-k\\arcosh(x-k)+k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore y=-k\\arcosh(x-k)+k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.33-q12","number":12,"question":"<p>Sketch the following graphs, given <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k&gt;1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, identifying where they intersect the coordinate axes and the equations of any asymptotes:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=k-\\arsinh(x+k)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\arcosh(x-3k)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=k-\\artanh(kx+k)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/solutions/assets/diagrams/133-sol-12a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/solutions/assets/diagrams/133-sol-12b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.33/solutions/assets/diagrams/133-sol-12c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]}]